OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'I had no reason not to donate
OL,4,Astem cells'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man from north London who signed up
OL,7,Fto be a stem cell donor last year said
OL,8,Fhe was initially hesitant but found the
OL,9,Fprocess "easy".
OL,11,FAlfred Mureithi, 24, from Islington, is
OL,12,Fone of 29,000 people registered to be a
OL,13,Fstem cell donor - the highest number in
OL,14,Fthree decades, according to the NHS
OL,15,FStem Cell Donor Registry.
OL,17,FHowever, NHS Blood and Transplant
OL,18,F(NHSBT) said more donors are needed,
OL,19,Fparticularly those from ethnic
OL,20,Fminorities.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
