OL,3,GNEWSA'I had no reason not to donate
OL,4,Astem cells'
OL,5,
OL,6,FStem cell donations can help people
OL,7,Fwith blood cancers, blood disorders,
OL,8,Fimmune deficiencies and genetic
OL,9,Fdisorders when their bone marrow stops
OL,10,Fworking properly or cannot produce
OL,11,Fhealthy blood cells.
